# Prove a bug fix at least twice

For bugs (`BUG-*`, live fail, residual after a “fix” release): do **not** mark fixed, close the issue, or set live **pass** in `TEST_PLAN` / `ABYSS_FIRST_CASES` / pilot results after one successful check.

Require **two independent proofs** (prefer two pilot runs, or two different fixtures). Unit/integration green does not replace the second live/pilot proof when the bug was live. Second proof fail voids the first: record fail, keep issue open. Evidence for both under `docs/pilot/results/`; link both before close.
